{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01158",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.82,
      "end_seconds": 8.62,
      "duration_seconds": 7.8,
      "text": "Hello doctor, you know, sorry, I took a wrong turn on the way here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.48,
      "end_seconds": 13.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. Tell me why you came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.78,
      "end_seconds": 18.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "It's loose stools after meals, mostly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.25,
      "end_seconds": 23.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "Since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.1,
      "end_seconds": 30.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "It's been going on for six months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.23,
      "end_seconds": 34.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "Rate it for me, mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.66,
      "end_seconds": 37.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.12,
      "text": "Mostly moderate."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.66,
      "end_seconds": 41.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.37,
      "end_seconds": 60.17,
      "duration_seconds": 17.8,
      "text": "It usually comes with cramping lower tummy pain. The cramping lower tummy pain? That's been for about three months. About cramping lower tummy pain, only after opening my bowels, and it's not much."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.16,
      "end_seconds": 65.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Have you had any weight loss or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.24,
      "end_seconds": 69.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "No weight loss or fever, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.06,
      "end_seconds": 78.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "On the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.9,
      "end_seconds": 84.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "My heart's been fine, as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.75,
      "end_seconds": 89.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.24,
      "end_seconds": 100.26,
      "duration_seconds": 10.02,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother. I walk the dog every morning. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.95,
      "end_seconds": 105.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.13,
      "end_seconds": 109.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "No, nothing I can think of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.36,
      "end_seconds": 126.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Are you on any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.75,
      "end_seconds": 130.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "No, nothing at the moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.17,
      "end_seconds": 146.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.47,
      "end_seconds": 151.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "No surgery, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.01,
      "end_seconds": 158.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "Any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.43,
      "end_seconds": 163.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "No, nothing as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.81,
      "end_seconds": 176.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.64,
      "end_seconds": 193.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "Alright, that's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.3,
      "end_seconds": 219.09,
      "duration_seconds": 6.79,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 84 beats a minute, pressure 125 over 81, temperature is 36.9 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.31,
      "end_seconds": 226.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "Is that alright, uh, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.95,
      "end_seconds": 231.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "Don't worry, we'll discuss it in a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.63,
      "end_seconds": 257.81,
      "duration_seconds": 10.18,
      "text": "So, based on your history, I'm honestly not certain yet. It could be irritable bowel syndrome with diarrhoea, or it might be coeliac disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 259.4,
      "end_seconds": 263.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.92,
      "end_seconds": 296.7,
      "duration_seconds": 30.78,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with irritable bowel syndrome with diarrhoea do well once it's treated properly. I'm sending you for a coeliac blood test because of diarrhoea. I want a stool test done, that's for diarrhoea. Keep a food diary and cut back on coffee. If the symptoms get worse, or you feel really unwell, please come to the emergency department."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.85,
      "end_seconds": 299.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "Yes, will do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.3,
      "end_seconds": 306.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "text": "We'll catch up in six weeks. Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.24,
      "end_seconds": 308.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.46,
      "end_seconds": 315.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "Take care now."
    }
  ]
}